    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d622">

                <pb facs="1087" n="987" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg987"/>

                <head>No. 622.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Mr. Heap.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-08-23"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 23,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Urge upon government prompt and condign punishment of the murderers, and
                    energetic measures to protect other American missionaries and citizens in the
                    disturbed region.</p>
                <closer><signed>EVARTS, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
